  "rerecordEncoder": "Film re-record on design C (2026-11-05, W2; recording R2 2026-11-08 after review R1). Recorder, scans, posters and fallbacks: nextjs/scripts/film/. Cuts: Playwright Chromium (bundled with @playwright/test in nextjs) screenshots of the real product UI at 1440x900 CSS, deviceScaleFactor 2, 25 fps x 18 s = 450 PNGs per cut, driven against the film clock, instant scrolls, two animation frames before each capture and every captured frame checked for an edge band (scan.mjs edgeBand) and retaken; encoded by nextjs/scripts/encode-cut-2x.sh with ffmpeg 7.1 (imageio-ffmpeg essentials build, libx264, preset medium, crf 20, yuv444p, two halves at one thread, concat -c copy, +faststart). Stage-1 fallbacks: the same two-halves path at yuv420p crf 20, 2880x1800 and lanczos 1440x900. Posters: the lossless source PNG of the named frame (framePngSha256), sharp 0.35.4: WebP quality 82 smartSubsample effort 6, AVIF quality 50 chroma 4:4:4 effort 6, 1x = lanczos3 1440x900; the phone pane = sharp extract(cropRect) of that same PNG, one lossy generation.",
